If a clinician integrates a behavioral-and-nonopioid-pain-therapy before an opioid-taper and integrates the behavioral-and-nonopioid-pain-therapy during the opioid-taper then the behavioral-and-nonopioid-pain-therapy can help a pain-management and can strengthen a clinician-patient-therapeutic-relationship and can improve a positive-tapering-outcome-likelihood.
If a clinician integrates a comorbid-mental-health-condition-treatment before an opioid-taper and integrates the comorbid-mental-health-condition-treatment during the opioid-taper then the comorbid-mental-health-condition-treatment can help a pain-management and can strengthen a clinician-patient-therapeutic-relationship and can improve a positive-tapering-outcome-likelihood.
